# A85 (kernel desktop, sd-base, no #Z): park bottom-right, dump idle; hover
# the "File" title (76,8) -> drop-down opens (title SELECTED = XOR inset 1);
# park bottom-right again (the tracker keeps the box open until a button
# edge), dump; hover the first item row from the right end of the box so the
# pointer covers no glyph, dump (item SELECTED = G_STRING XOR); park; click
# outside -> cancel: box restored, title normal, dump.
200 parkbr
1100 mark A_IDLE
1400 move 76 8
1800 parkbr
2400 mark B_FILE_OPEN
2700 move 200 28
3200 mark C_ITEM_HOVER
3500 parkbr
4000 down
4003 up
4600 mark D_CLOSED
